gine/godot/issues/comments/2449675974","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98666#issuecomment-2449675974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98666","id":2449675974,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SAxbG","user":{"login":"777joe","id":83246902,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMjQ2OTAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83246902?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe","html_url":"https://github.com/777joe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T11:57:21Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T11:57:21Z","body":"> Just to rule that out from the get go: Are you comparing a self-build Godot editor to the prebuild one from the Website? If so please build 4.4.dev3 yourself to make sure that this is not just an issue with compiler optimization. FYI 4.4.dev3 is built from commit [f4af820](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/f4af8201bac157b9d47e336203d3e8a8ef729de2) .\r\n\r\nI have been regularly testing with the build artefacts from CI after every commit. This behaviour wasn't there in last week's builds. I just mentioned 4.4.dev3 because it is the most recent official build. I also compiled master with `production=yes` and `speed=optimize`, but still get the same behaviour.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2449675974/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2467239329","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98666#issuecomment-2467239329","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98666","id":2467239329,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TDxWh","user":{"login":"777joe","id":83246902,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMjQ2OTAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83246902?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe","html_url":"https://github.com/777joe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/777joe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-11T04:59:09Z","updated_at":"2024-11-11T04:59:09Z","body":"Ok, on `git bisect`ing i found https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/88427 to be the problem. On reverting those changes, rebasing on master, and recompiling, the problem went away. Can anyone else confirm if this a bug?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2467239329/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2467455495","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98666#issuecomment-2467455495","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98666","id":2467455495,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TEmIH","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-11T07:51:20Z","updated_at":"2024-11-11T07:51:20Z","body":"Sounds like a performance regression.\r\n\r\nWe use the method to get an icon from a class name for every completion option, so the changes in there are probably to heavy to call for each completion option.\r\n\r\nThis seems like it could impact performance quite a bit:\r\nhttps://github.com/CrayolaEater/godot/blob/fb58ea6c89ff3f9e970e436982c76e96adccdefc/editor/editor_node.cpp#L4845-L4846\r\nMaybe a lightweight check on the script name before calling `ResourceLoader.exists` could prevent this. But personally I don't think `get_class_icon` should handle script paths at all, from its name I would assume it only handles class_name and native class names.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2467455495/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644840748","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98666#issuecomment-2644840748","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98666","id":2644840748,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dpREs","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-08T10:29:59Z","updated_at":"2025-02-08T10:29:59Z","body":"#101489 might have had an influence on this. I'm not able to reproduce the issue on my quite recent phone and I can't get a hold of my old low end tablet. Could someone check who is able to reproduce this?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"rea